        "why": "_selection_pdraw returns max(p, 1e-300), so on rows where the mass model gives exactly zero the floor -- not the density -- is stored and multiplicativity fails there. Those rows carry a weight of order 1e-288 and cannot affect any sum; they are excluded from the exactness comparison and included in every integral."
